{"id":138,"date":"2026-09-14T08:53:22","date_gmt":"2026-09-14T08:53:22","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/goodwilltechnologies.in\/?p=138"},"modified":"2026-09-14T08:54:18","modified_gmt":"2026-09-14T08:54:18","slug":"why-use-linux","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/goodwilltechnologies.in\/why-use-linux\/","title":{"rendered":"Why use Linux ?"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-794e3cfa wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-794e3cfa wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\" src=\"https:\/\/goodwilltechnologies.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/0_Qqqd7UsfFDPL7WXh.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-141\"\/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">What is Linux ?<br>Linux is a free, open-source operating system that manages computer hardware and lets you run programs, similar to Microsoft Windows or Apple macOS.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Key Benefits of Linux<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Cost:<\/strong> Linux and most of its software cost nothing, saving money on licenses.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Privacy and No Bloat:<\/strong> Linux does not track your data, show ads, or force unwanted pre-installed apps onto your system.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Customization:<\/strong> You can change everything from the desktop look to core system components.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Performance:<\/strong> Linux runs fast and smooth, even on old computers that struggle with newer versions of Windows or macOS.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Security:<\/strong> Its open-source code is checked by global developers, making it less vulnerable to viruses.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Developer Skills:<\/strong> Linux powers most of the internet, cloud servers, and supercomputers, making it an essential tool for IT career.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><\/ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><\/ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>What is Linux ?Linux is a free, open-source operating system that manages computer hardware and lets you run programs, similar to Microsoft Windows or Apple macOS. Key Benefits of Linux<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-138","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-uncategorized"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/goodwilltechnologies.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/138","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/goodwilltechnologies.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/goodwilltechnologies.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/goodwilltechnologies.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/goodwilltechnologies.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=138"}],"version-history":[{"count":4,"href":"https:\/\/goodwilltechnologies.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/138\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":143,"href